---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 px-6 bg-bg">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-display text-white mb-12" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">HOW IT WORKS</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0">
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="relative px-0 md:pr-8 pb-10 md:pb-0 md:border-r border-b md:border-b-0 border-muted/30">
        <span class="font-display text-[5rem] text-accent opacity-[0.12] leading-none absolute top-0 left-0 select-none pointer-events-none">01</span>
        <div class="relative pt-12">
          <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.8rem] mb-3">ENTER A HANDLE</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Drop in any public profile from Instagram, X, or TikTok. No login required for public accounts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="relative px-0 md:px-8 pb-10 md:pb-0 md:border-r border-b md:border-b-0 border-muted/30">
        <span class="font-display text-[5rem] text-accent opacity-[0.12] leading-none absolute top-0 left-0 md:left-8 select-none pointer-events-none">02</span>
        <div class="relative pt-12">
          <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.8rem] mb-3">CONNECT IF PRIVATE</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            If the profile is private, connect your account with read-only access so we can view their follows as a mutual follower would. We never post. You can revoke anytime.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="relative px-0 md:pl-8 pt-10 md:pt-0">
        <span class="font-display text-[5rem] text-accent opacity-[0.12] leading-none absolute top-0 left-0 md:left-8 select-none pointer-events-none">03</span>
        <div class="relative pt-12">
          <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.8rem] mb-3">GET THE CRINGE REPORT</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A shareable breakdown: cringe score, flagged accounts by category, bot detection, and pattern analysis. Screenshot it. Send it. Act on it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
